{#- An earlier agent's free-text field, which is Markdown, as one list item that keeps its structure.
    A one-line value follows its label; a longer one starts on the next line, indented under the
    item, so its paragraphs, lists and fenced blocks stay inside it. The item has no trailing newline. -#}
{% macro item(label, value) -%}
{% set text = value.strip('\n') -%}
- {{ label }}:{% if '\n' in text %}{{ '\n' }}{{ text | indent(2, first=True) }}{% else %} {{ text }}{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
